- [ ] **Mixed Precision**: FP16/TF32 where appropriate
- [ ] **Persistent Kernels**: Keep data in registers across iterations
- [ ] **CUDA Graphs**: Reduce launch overhead
- [ ] **Double Buffering**: Overlap computation with memory transfers

